 "lead_paragraphs": [
  {
   "label": {
    "en": "CAPITAL RETURNS:",
    "zh": "现金分配："
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "FY13-26 OCF $1,011.6B less capex $370.7B left **$640.8B FCF**. Buybacks **$248.4B (39%)**; dividends **$217.5B (34%)**; acquisitions **$100.6B in FY22-26 alone** (Activision $69.1B).",
    "zh": "FY13-26 OCF $10,116 亿减资本开支 $3,707 亿，得 **FCF $6,408 亿**。回购 **$2,484 亿（39%）**；股息 **$2,175 亿（34%）**；仅 FY22-26 收购就达 **$1,006 亿**（Activision $691 亿）。"
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "en": "NET SHARES:",
    "zh": "净股数变化："
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "Diluted shares FY12 8,506M to FY26 7,453M, **down 12.4%**. Buybacks now mostly offset stock pay: FY26 buybacks $22.3B vs SBC $12.4B; **7,446M** diluted in Q1 FY27.",
    "zh": "稀释股数由 FY12 的 8,506M 降至 FY26 的 7,453M，**减少 12.4%**。目前回购主要用于抵消股权激励：FY26 回购 $22.3B，SBC $12.4B；Q1 FY27 稀释股数 **74.46 亿股**。"
   }
  }
 ],
 "commentary": [
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Cloud growth reaccelerated.",
    "zh": "云业务重新加速。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Revenue grew 17.8% in FY26 to $331.8B and 18.8% in Q1 FY27, led by Azure (+48%). Commercial RPO of $677B (+73%) gives multi-year visibility; devices (-22% Windows OEM) are now a small drag.",
    "zh": "FY26 营收增长 17.8% 至 $3,318 亿，Q1 FY27 增长 18.8%，主要靠 Azure（+48%）。商业 RPO $6,770 亿（+73%）提供多年可见度；设备业务（Windows OEM -22%）已只是小幅拖累。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Capex is eating the FCF.",
    "zh": "资本开支正在吞掉 FCF。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Capex went from 27% of OCF (FY22) to 63% (FY26). OCF rose 54% from FY24 to FY26, yet FCF fell from $74.1B to $67.0B; TTM FCF is $60.0B. FY27 capex incl. leases runs near $195B.",
    "zh": "资本开支占 OCF 由 FY22 的 27% 升至 FY26 的 63%。FY24-FY26 OCF 增长 54%，FCF 却由 $741 亿降至 $670 亿；TTM FCF 为 $600 亿。FY27 含租赁的资本开支接近 $1,950 亿。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Margins have held, so far.",
    "zh": "利润率至今守住了。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "EBIT margin rose from 42.1% (FY22) to 46.8% (FY26). Depreciation is the delayed cost: D&A climbed from 6.4% to 11.8% of revenue, and management expects the FY27 margin to slip slightly. My model lets D&A reach 18.5% of revenue by FY31, so margin holds only if pricing on AI services keeps up.",
    "zh": "EBIT 利润率由 FY22 的 42.1% 升至 FY26 的 46.8%。折旧是滞后的成本：折旧摊销占营收由 6.4% 升至 11.8%，管理层预计 FY27 利润率小幅下降。我的模型让折旧摊销在 FY31 达到营收的 18.5%，只有 AI 服务定价跟得上，利润率才能守住。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "OpenAI sits outside operations.",
    "zh": "OpenAI 在经营之外。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Microsoft owns ~27% of OpenAI, valued at ~$135B in the Oct 2025 recapitalisation; I add it to equity value rather than to EBIT. FY26 other income of $13.7B includes OpenAI-related gains. The stake adds about $18 per share; it is not marked to later funding rounds.",
    "zh": "微软持有 OpenAI 约 27%，按 2025年10月重组估值约 $1,350 亿；我把它加到股权价值中，而不是计入 EBIT。FY26 其他收益 $137 亿包含 OpenAI 相关收益。这部分每股约 $18，未按后续融资轮重新估值。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Payouts are steady, not growing fast.",
    "zh": "分配稳定，但增长不快。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Dividends plus buybacks were $48.7B in FY26, 73% of FCF. With AAA ratings and net debt/EBITDA 0.15x even after finance leases, the balance sheet can fund the build-out.",
    "zh": "FY26 股息加回购 $487 亿，占 FCF 73%。AAA 评级，计入融资租赁后净债务/EBITDA 也仅 0.15 倍，资产负债表足以支撑建设。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "My DCF is well below the market.",
    "zh": "我的 DCF 明显低于市场。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Base $404.69 (WACC 9.7%, g 3%, beta 1.05) needs $631B revenue by FY31 (13.7% a year) at a 47.6% EBIT margin, with capex falling from 50% to 21% of revenue; TV is 84% of EV. At $517.99 that is -22%; Morningstar ($600) and the Street ($636) are higher: about $71 of the gap to Morningstar is its faster growth ($715B FY31 revenue) and $110 my higher WACC.",
    "zh": "基准价值 $404.69（WACC 9.7%，g 3%，beta 1.05）要求 FY31 营收 $6,310 亿（年增 13.7%）、EBIT 利润率 47.6%，资本开支占营收由 50% 降到 21%；终值占 EV 84%。按 $517.99 计为 -22%；Morningstar（$600）和华尔街（$636）都更高：与 Morningstar 的差距中，约 $71 来自其更快的增长（FY31 营收 $7,150 亿），$110 来自我更高的 WACC。"
   }
  }
 ],
 "footnotes": {
  "en": [
   "FY12-26 from SEC 10-K XBRL (fiscal years end Jun 30). D&A* = depreciation + intangible and finance-lease amortisation. Acquisitions FY22-26 from the analyst model; FY12-21 not in XBRL (--).",
   "EBITDA* = operating income + D&A. FCF = OCF - cash capex (excl. finance leases). ROIC* = op. income x (1-21%) / (equity + debt - cash). Dividend/Sh.* = dividends paid / diluted shares.",
   "Header: Nov 16, 2026 close $517.99, 7,427M shares; book value = Sep 30, 2026 equity $470.5B; TTM P/E (EPS $19.15); P/FCF on TTM FCF $60.0B. FY22-26 P/E, yields and Mkt cap* from StockAnalysis (FY-end).",
   "DCF: Pythia model MSFT_DCF_Model, Nov 17, 2026; WACC 9.7%, g 3.0%, horizon FY27-31. Morningstar FV $600 (Jul 31, 2025). Street avg target = 58-analyst average (S&P Global via StockAnalysis).",
   "Sources: Microsoft 10-K FY2026, Q1 FY27 release (Oct 28, 2026), Sep 2026 segment recast 8-K; SEC EDGAR; StockAnalysis; Morningstar."
  ],
  "zh": [
   "FY12-26 数据取自 SEC 10-K XBRL（财年截至 6月30日）。折旧摊销* = 折旧 + 无形资产与融资租赁摊销。FY22-26 收购支出取自分析模型；FY12-21 XBRL 中没有（--）。",
   "EBITDA* = 营业利润 + 折旧摊销。FCF = OCF - 现金资本开支（不含融资租赁）。ROIC* = 营业利润 ×（1-21%）/（权益 + 债务 - 现金）。每股股息* = 已付股息 / 稀释股数。",
   "首行：2026年11月16日收盘 $517.99，74.27 亿股；每股账面 = 2026年9月30日权益 $4,705 亿；TTM P/E（EPS $19.15）；P/FCF 按 TTM FCF $600 亿。FY22-26 P/E、收益率与市值*取自 StockAnalysis（年末口径）。",
   "DCF：Pythia 模型 MSFT_DCF_Model，2026年11月17日；WACC 9.7%，g 3.0%，预测期 FY27-31。Morningstar 合理价值 $600（2025年7月31日）。华尔街平均目标价为 58 位分析师平均（S&P Global，经 StockAnalysis）。",
   "来源：Microsoft FY2026 10-K、Q1 FY27 业绩公告（2026年10月28日）、2026年9月分部重组 8-K；SEC EDGAR；StockAnalysis；Morningstar。"
  ]
